+ * that any token parser processing the returned string from
+ * NV_CTRL_BINARY_DATA_METAMODES be implemented to gracefully ignore
+ * unrecognized tokens.
+ *
+ * E.g.,
+ *
+ *   "id=50, switchable=yes, source=xconfig :: CRT-0: 1024x768 @1024x768 +0+0"
+ */
+
